    "key": "task-outcome/MR-CAP-001",
    "verified": true,
    "value": "COMPLETE\nImplementation: added tracker-api/tests/services/facebook-scraper.test.ts (new file, the only one touched). It holds 12 Vitest tests for buildMarketplaceSearchUrl. It mocks ../../src/lib/prisma before importing the scraper and checks parsed URL origin, pathname and searchParams. Coverage: location slug (origin, 'New York City' -> newyorkcity, whitespace and case normalization -> philadelphia), query (including a space), exact=false, radius=65, maxPrice=6500 included, maxPrice left out for null, undefined, 0 and a missing key. Placement follows decision-002. No changes under src, existing tests or config.\nReview: NOT_RUN. The Orchestrator says review was not required for this task, and the CLAUDE.md standard sequence has no review stage.\nTesting: PASS on Tester attempt 1. npm --prefix tracker-api test gave 3 files and 27/27 tests passing (15 existing + 12 new). All acceptance criteria were met.\nCaveats: the Tester could not run git diff, so the no-src-change criterion relies on the Orchestrator's list of changed files. Known gap that was out of scope: a negative maxPrice is still added to the URL (source uses if (params.maxPrice)), and nothing tests it. Non-integer radius is also untested."
